/CLAUDE.md
/.claude
/.gsd

__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

.venv/

# The shapes, not one name: `.env.example` tells the developer to create a gitignored `.env`, and
# a second project is kept in a copy of it (`.env.staging`, `.env.local`) that `.env` alone misses.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The credential files `.env.example` points at by path. Apple lets the DeviceCheck `.p8` be
# downloaded exactly once, and an ADC JSON is the same shape: a key committed here is a key
# revoked in a console, never one taken back.
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
application_default_credentials.json

.idea/
.vscode/
/.planning/research/.cache/
/.planning/state.json
/.planning/milestone.lock

# `pytest-cov` writes both into the repository root.
.coverage
htmlcov/
